{"id":1188,"date":"2022-01-24T15:00:22","date_gmt":"2022-01-24T14:00:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/?page_id=1188"},"modified":"2025-07-18T11:26:35","modified_gmt":"2025-07-18T09:26:35","slug":"juridique","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/ressources\/juridique\/","title":{"rendered":"Juridique"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-group single-content\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#conventions\">Conventions collectives<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#employeur\">Fonction employeur<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#intermittence\">Intermittence<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#societe\">Soci\u00e9t\u00e9s civiles<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"conventions\">Conventions collectives<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Quelles sont les conventions collectives applicables dans le secteur culturel&nbsp;? <br>Vous trouverez ci-joint le <a href=\"https:\/\/cnm.fr\/fiches-pratiques\/les-conventions-collectives-dans-le-spectacle\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Guide explicatif conventions collectives &#8211; CCNEAC \/ CCNSVP \/ etc. (Fiches pratiques CNM)<\/a> <br>et ci-dessous les liens vers les conventions collectives.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Ressources sur les conventions collectives : <\/strong><a href=\"http:\/\/www.ccneac.fr\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><br>Site d\u00e9di\u00e9 \u00e0 la Convention collective nationale des entreprises artistiques et culturelles &#8211; CCNEAC<\/a><br><a href=\"https:\/\/www.legifrance.gouv.fr\/affichIDCC.do?idConvention=KALICONT000005635177\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Convention collective nationale de l\u2019animation &#8211; ECLAT<\/a><br><a href=\"https:\/\/cnm.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/ccn_sv_prive_clauses.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Convention collective nationale des entreprises du secteur priv\u00e9 du spectacle vivant &#8211; CCNSVP<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Ressource compl\u00e9mentaire : <\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Guide_paritaire_application.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"720\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.11.17-1024x720.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2125\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.11.17-1024x720.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.11.17-300x211.png 300w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.11.17-768x540.png 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.11.17.png 1124w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Guide_paritaire_application.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Document explicatif sur la mise en place de l&rsquo;avenant 182 &#8211; convention collective ECLAT<\/a> &#8211; (document Hexop\u00e9e)<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"employeur\"><br>Fonction employeur<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"483\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.27.19-1024x483.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2136\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.27.19-1024x483.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.27.19-300x141.png 300w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.27.19-768x362.png 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.27.19-1536x724.png 1536w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.27.19-2048x966.png 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Cr\u00e9er son association et toutes les responsabilit\u00e9s employeurs compil\u00e9s dans l&rsquo;excellent <a href=\"https:\/\/www.associatheque.fr\/fr\/association-employeur\/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">guide du site l&rsquo;Associath\u00e8que &#8211; \u00e0 explorer ici.<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"454\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.19.45-1024x454.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2129\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.19.45-1024x454.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.19.45-300x133.png 300w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.19.45-768x340.png 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.19.45-1536x681.png 1536w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.19.45-2048x908.png 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Tout savoir sur <a href=\"https:\/\/www.artcena.fr\/guide\/droit-et-administration\/creer-et-gerer-sa-compagnie\/la-licence-dentrepreneurs-de-spectacles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">la licence d&rsquo;entrepreneur du spectacle, les r\u00e9ponses \u00e0 vos questions ici<\/a> (document Artcena).<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mesdemarches.culture.gouv.fr\/loc_fr\/mcc\/requests\/THEAT_LICEN_declaration_00\/?__CSRFTOKEN__=ad5455d4-c481-4c7e-96e1-cd93b63df8f4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"578\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.22.19-1024x578.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2132\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.22.19-1024x578.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.22.19-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.22.19-768x433.png 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.22.19-1536x867.png 1536w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.22.19-2048x1156.png 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Voici le lien pour <a href=\"https:\/\/mesdemarches.culture.gouv.fr\/loc_fr\/mcc\/requests\/THEAT_LICEN_declaration_00\/?__CSRFTOKEN__=ad5455d4-c481-4c7e-96e1-cd93b63df8f4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Lien pour la 1\u00e8re demande de la licence d&rsquo;entrepreneur du spectacle<\/a> (Minist\u00e8re de la Culture).<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium is-style-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.opale.asso.fr\/IMG\/pdf\/201703_avise_crdlaculture_ficherh.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"205\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-08-a\u0300-21.22.55-1-205x300.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1722\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-08-a\u0300-21.22.55-1-205x300.png 205w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-08-a\u0300-21.22.55-1-699x1024.png 699w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-08-a\u0300-21.22.55-1-768x1125.png 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-08-a\u0300-21.22.55-1.png 882w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 205px) 100vw, 205px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pr\u00e9sentation des enjeux majeurs et des \u00e9l\u00e9ments \u00e0 investiguer prioritairement, en termes de ressources humaines, au moment du diagnostic d\u2019une association culturelle. Cette fiche a \u00e9t\u00e9 r\u00e9alis\u00e9e par le CRDLA Culture en 2017 dans le cadre des travaux pilot\u00e9s par l\u2019<a href=\"http:\/\/www.avise.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Avise<\/a> pour enrichir la \u00ab&nbsp;Bo\u00eete \u00e0 outils Diagnostic&nbsp;\u00bb \u00e0 destination des charg\u00e9\u00b7e\u00b7s de mission du Dispositif Local d&rsquo;Accompagnement.<br><br><a href=\"https:\/\/www.opale.asso.fr\/IMG\/pdf\/201703_avise_crdlaculture_ficherh.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">T\u00e9l\u00e9charger la fiche de l&rsquo;Opale ici.<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-default\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.opale.asso.fr\/rubrique49.html\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"440\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.30.09-1024x440.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2139\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.30.09-1024x440.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.30.09-300x129.png 300w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.30.09-768x330.png 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/Capture-de\u0301cran-2022-02-21-a\u0300-15.30.09.png 1326w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pour aller plus loin. Besoin d&rsquo;accompagnement ? Aide \u00e0 la structuration ? <a href=\"https:\/\/www.opale.asso.fr\/rubrique49.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">La DLA &#8211; Dispositif Local d&rsquo;Accompagnement (site OPALE).<\/a> Le DLA est un programme national d\u2019appui aux associations employeuses, cr\u00e9\u00e9 en 2004 par le minist\u00e8re de l\u2019Emploi et la Caisse des d\u00e9p\u00f4ts et consignations. Opale anime pour ce dispositif une mission de Centre de Ressources sur la fili\u00e8re Culture, le CRDLA.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"intermittence\"><br>Intermittence<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Qu\u2019est-ce que l\u2019intermittence ? Que vous souhaitiez d\u00e9couvrir le sujet ou l\u2019approfondir, vous trouverez ici quelques cl\u00e9s et points de vue sur ce r\u00e9gime d\u2019assurance ch\u00f4mage et ses sp\u00e9cificit\u00e9s.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Retrouvez toutes les informations sur l&rsquo;intermittence sur <a href=\"https:\/\/www.opale.asso.fr\/rubrique190.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">le site ressource de notre partenaire OPALE ici.<\/a><br><a href=\"https:\/\/www.opale.asso.fr\/article193.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">D\u00e9couvrir l&rsquo;intermittence ici.<\/a><br>T\u00e9l\u00e9charger la fiche <a href=\"https:\/\/www.opale.asso.fr\/IMG\/pdf\/2019_emploi_intermittents_cies_opale_crdlaculture_synavi.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">\u00ab\u00a0L\u2019emploi d\u2019intermittents dans les compagnies sous statut associatif\u00a0\u00bb ici<\/a> <br>T\u00e9l\u00e9charger la fiche <a href=\"https:\/\/www.opale.asso.fr\/IMG\/pdf\/2019_emploi_intermittents_cies_opale_crdlaculture_synavi.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">\u00ab\u00a0Intermittence et emploi dans le spectacle vivant\u00a0\u00bb ici<\/a><br><br><strong>Ressources compl\u00e9mentaires :<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<p class=\"responsive-video-wrap clr\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Intermittent, pr\u00e9caire \u00e0 temps plein ? - #DATAGUEULE 8\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/ftwXvWShZMg?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/p>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022&nbsp;Vid\u00e9o sur le r\u00e9gime de l\u2019intermittence r\u00e9sum\u00e9 en 3 minutes&nbsp;: historique, chiffres, r\u00e9formes, etc. \u00ab\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/youtu.be\/ftwXvWShZMg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Intermittents, pr\u00e9caires \u00e0 temps plein&nbsp;?<\/a>\u00a0\u00bb (#Datagueule, juillet 2014. 3 minutes).<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Les bases pour conna\u00eetre le r\u00e9gime de l\u2019intermittence. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.mescachets.com\/intermittent-spectacle\/statut-intermittent-du-spectacle?gclid=CjwKCAiAx8KQBhAGEiwAD3EiPxWmGWSu-9NMo4fnMN7RfepZ8Gbgq_YmaYsSO14nH1vZRHfpxn5blRoCSc8QAvD_BwE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">D\u00e9couvrir l&rsquo;histoire de l&rsquo;intermittence ici.<\/a><br>Simulateur indemnit\u00e9s P\u00f4le Emploi pour intermittent\u00b7es cr\u00e9\u00e9 par mescachets.com. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.mescachets.com\/simulation_indemnite_mensuelle_intermittent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">D\u00e9couvrir l&rsquo;outil ici.<\/a><br>Annexe 8 &#8211; Techniciens du spectacle &#8211; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.pole-emploi.fr\/files\/live\/sites\/PE\/files\/masters\/spectacle\/les-notices-reglementaires\/Notice%20-%20Liste%20Annexe%208.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">R\u00e9glementation \u00e0 t\u00e9l\u00e9charger ici<\/a> (P\u00f4le Emploi).<br>Qu\u2019est-ce que l\u2019intermittence ? <a href=\"https:\/\/www.opale.asso.fr\/rubrique190.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Pour d\u00e9couvrir ou approfondir sur le sujet<\/a> (Opale).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"societe\"><br>Soci\u00e9t\u00e9s civiles<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"societe-civile\">Les organismes de gestion collective, bien que de droit priv\u00e9, exercent une mission reconnue d&rsquo;int\u00e9r\u00eat g\u00e9n\u00e9ral sous la tutelle du minist\u00e8re de la Culture. Elles per\u00e7oivent et r\u00e9partissent des droits d&rsquo;auteur au sens propre (auteurs, compositeurs, etc.) et d&rsquo;autres des droits voisins (artistes interpr\u00e8tes). <a href=\"https:\/\/metiers.philharmoniedeparis.fr\/aides-societes-civiles.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Cette page r\u00e9pertorie tous les liens des soci\u00e9t\u00e9s civiles et leurs aides <\/a>(Cit\u00e9 de la Musique &#8211; Philarmonie de Paris).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Voici la liste des soci\u00e9t\u00e9s civiles : <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/spedidam.fr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPEDIDAM<\/a><br><a href=\"https:\/\/www.sacem.fr\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SACEM<\/a><br><a href=\"https:\/\/www.adami.fr\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ADAMI<\/a><br><a href=\"https:\/\/www.sacd.fr\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SACD<\/a><br><a href=\"https:\/\/www.scpp.fr\/fr\/Pages\/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nore